              ],
              "text": "10:30 PM Thursday. The resident goes to bed. The Porch Cam is on battery at **25%**, not charging, and everything is online. Every 30 minutes the camera checks in through the home Wi-Fi with its battery level and whether it is charging; the Kestrel cloud keeps that as the camera's status. No alerts on the phone."
            },
            {
              "id": "raccoon",
              "time": "2026-10-02T01:05",
              "edges": [
                "cam->router",
                "router->ingest",
                "router->clipstore",
                "ingest->classifier",
                "classifier->ingest"
              ],
              "codeRefs": [
